  "Description":          "Multimodal Scene Creation: places the avatars of the virtual meeting in the Multimodal Scene Descriptors, each at its Spatial Attitude, adds the speech of each to its mouth (a standard 1.6 m above its Spatial Attitude, where the source of the speech of a Speaking Avatar is implicitly), and gives the Multimodal Scene Descriptors and, for Response and Scene Rendering, each avatar with its ID, its speech and its Spatial Attitude.",

